<div class="ca-instructions">
  <section class="ca-instructions-section">
    <h3>Keyboard Shortcuts</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><kbd>Shift</kbd> + click on a link — open passage editor</li>
      <li>Click on a link — cycle direction (single-passage only)</li>
      <li>Right-click on a link — delete</li>
      <li>Drag a node — reposition</li>
      <li>Drag from an anchor dot — create new link</li>
      <li>Double-click a node — open node settings</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="ca-instructions-section">
    <h3>Link Types</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>⟷ Both ways</strong> — players can travel in either direction</li>
      <li><strong>→ Forward only</strong> — one-way from source to target</li>
      <li><strong>← Backward only</strong> — one-way from target to source</li>
      <li><strong>✕ Blocked</strong> — link exists but cannot be traversed</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="ca-instructions-section">
    <h3>Multi-Passage Links</h3>
    <p>Shift+click any link to add multiple named passages between two nodes. Each passage has its own direction rule. Reducing to one passage restores simple link behavior.</p>
  </section>
</div>
